R</given-names></name><name><surname>Noller</surname><given-names>HF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Detailed analysis of the higher-order structure of 16S-like ribosomal ribonucleic acids</article-title><source>Microbiol Rev</source><year>1983</year><volume>47</volume><fpage>621</fpage><lpage>669</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6363901</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>